  "bodyHash": "7954c797c08f53f5",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_6d1ee7ae-0ec9-48af-97fb-5ceccb90ef57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"323\" height=\"323\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fCREATEFRANCE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_00b06b57-5783-4c54-a00c-c012ec97c019.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SykPYgYkKk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/647559221855911938?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.1-Create_France?style=flat-square&logo=CURSEFORGE&label=Create France&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"25\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/En Ligne-Server?style=flat-square&logo=Minetest&label=Serveur&labelColor=#1fcf5a&color=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"25\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>目前版本</strong>：1.1.1<br>已修復 1.1.2 橋樑結構的 FPS 下降問題，並新增橋樑說明以幫助理解運作方式<br><strong>相容性</strong>：Minecraft 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 Neoforge + 搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 5 與 Create 6</a><br>1.1.2<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_253e8444-3c0c-46f9-9567-20d0b85ee4e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"521\"><br>1.0.8<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_cf97e8e6-dd06-47dc-bba2-f235a43ce4ca.png\"></p>\n<p>1.0.5</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_9a9b143e-66a0-4f4a-ac49-55aee81e41ec.png\"></p>\n<p>1.0.4</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_0efb8457-ef0e-4f5e-bca9-3c9d0d44e938.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"303\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_72d5e724-4e88-4ce7-9367-3a6869e740d6.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_eb7cfdea-6204-4b8b-90d8-d48f169d33e2.png\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>關於模組</h2>\n<p>歡迎使用<strong>Create Furnitures</strong>，這款模組透過加入工業風格的家具來提升你的 Minecraft 體驗！如果你是<strong>Create</strong>模組的粉絲，這款模組將完美搭配你的建築，引入各種材質與顏色的桌子、椅子和凳子。非常適合裝飾工作室、用餐區，或是舒適的蒸汽龐克角落！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h2>主要特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>桌子</strong>：提供 4 種變體，基於 Create 模組的經典材質：<br><br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>安山岩外殼</strong></li>\n<li><strong>銅製外殼</strong></li>\n<li><strong>鐵軌外殼</strong></li>\n<li><strong>黃銅外殼</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>椅子</strong>：每張椅子都與桌子材質相匹配，呈現和諧的外觀。你可以坐上去，獲得極致的沉浸感！</li>\n<li><strong>凳子</strong>：小巧實用，最適合擺放在舒適的角落或工業工作室中。</li>\n<li><strong>顏色</strong>：每種家具均提供 4 種不同顏色，讓你擁有更多自訂空間。<br><br><br></li>\n<li><strong>柱子</strong>：新增柱子</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型安山岩柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>小型黃銅柱</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>高型安山岩柱</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>遊戲截圖</h2>\n<p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_2baae0a8-fe7a-426d-9e02-308d3f103323.png\"></em></p>\n<p><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162995/description_129a7a38-69f4-401e-962b-c75f89bbd783.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></em></p>\n<h2>如何製作家具？</h2>\n<p>製作這些家具既簡單又直觀！只需將 Create 外殼放入石頭切割機即可。</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>與 Create 的整合</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>家具使用來自 Create 模組的材質，確保完美的視覺整合。</li>\n<li>相容於進階的 Create 機械設備，例如<strong>組裝台</strong>。</li>\n<li>為你的機械系統與工業基地增添裝飾氣息！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>確保你已安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>模組。</li>\n<li>從本頁面下載<strong>Create Furnitures</strong>檔案。</li>\n<li>將 .jar 檔案放入你的 Minecraft 安裝資料夾中的<strong>mods</strong>資料夾內。</li>\n<li>啟動遊戲，享受全新的家具吧！</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>相容性與問題回報</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相容性</strong>：適用於所有與<strong>Create</strong>相容的版本。</li>\n<li><strong>已知問題</strong>：目前無。若發現任何問題，請在「Issues」區塊進行回報。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>作者</strong>：<em>Arginou</em></li>\n<li><strong>素材與靈感</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>模組</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc29e08a-1785-4b42-8b4e-ddc9a55aa6ae.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"></h2>\n<h2>實用連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>我的社群伺服器整合包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/serveur-create-france-communauty-friends-coop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create France Serveur</a></li>\n<li>我的 Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ScMHdge2uv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;&gt;連結&lt;&lt;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>感謝下載 Create Furnitures！</h3>\n<p>如果你喜歡這個模組，別忘了留下評論與評分！這能幫助它獲得更多人關注並持續優化。</p>",
